			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 230001101,
					"content": "So! The story today took place in a faraway country. Please enjoy \"The Tale of the Golden-Haired Hero\"!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maddah"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001102,
					"content": "...When the Exuvia fell from the sky, ancient Stone Harbor was in chaos. But thanks to this traveler's feat, the land saw peace once again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maddah"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001103,
					"content": "...However, a monster emerged from the waters, and fierce battle was joined. Even the sky changed color, and the very land was thrown out of order. Even the Jade Chamber was blown to smithereens!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maddah"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001104,
					"content": "...The waves settled, but conflicts remained. The Traveler stood forth to quell the disagreements between mortal and adeptus. Their sage words turned the tide, ushering Liyue onto a new path!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maddah"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001105,
					"content": "The story... It's pretty new, and yet, the events don't flow logically at all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nayab"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001106,
					"content": "That's right! How did the protagonist persuade both sides even though the protagonist hasn't said much before then...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Izem"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001107,
					"content": "Um... Well... Today's story ends here! Please do come again! Haha...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Maddah"
				}
			]
		},
