			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 230001201,
					"content": "Well then, the story for today took place in a faraway country. Please enjoy \"An Outland Blade in Inazuma\"!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maddah"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001202,
					"content": "#...The thunder can be heard beyond distant seas — the destined Traveler is about to arrive. {M#He}{F#She} roamed the islands like lightning, {M#his}{F#her} great deeds sung of by all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maddah"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001203,
					"content": "...Though aforetime she did as she pleased, the wicked witch could not escape defeat. Even the sea-severing strike could not halt the Traveler's steps!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maddah"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001204,
					"content": "...And the Statue of the Omnipresent God, powered by the wishes of thousands of hearts, shattered the skies with a mighty roar, casting all enemies to the wayside!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Maddah"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001205,
					"content": "The story... It's pretty new, and yet, the events don't flow logically at all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nayab"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001206,
					"content": "That whole bit with the giant statue just comes out of nowhere, almost as if we were running out of believable story bits or something...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230001207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Izem"
				},
				{
					"id": 230001207,
					"content": "Um... Well... Today's story ends here! Please do come again! Haha...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Maddah"
				}
			]
		},
		{
